#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "192_Mysterious Man"
msgid "Hmph. You must've met that good-for-nothing brother of mine. That simpleton, sticking ranks on people and gloating like the next messiah."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "204_Mysterious Man"
msgid "He was nothing but a lowlife that ran off when he couldn't live up to our noble ideals."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "216_Mysterious Man"
msgid "I'm Noir, of the Dark Clan. Do not confuse me with my brother."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "228_Kiryu"
msgid "Why are you all after me?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "240_Noir"
msgid "As for that, I have no idea. But I follow my orders."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "252_Noir"
msgid "I'm supposed to wait until the boss lures you here. You come, I beat you. Very simple."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
